    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/62cff07c70f3bf56faa72dca84a748a4.poster.avif?t=1746074952\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/62cff07c70f3bf56faa72dca84a748a4.apng?t=1746074952\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span><strong>Welcome to CRITTER ISLE!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/150a7420403147241bc96f11b2721ad9.poster.avif?t=1746074952\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/150a7420403147241bc96f11b2721ad9.apng?t=1746074952\" class=\"bb_img\" width=80 height=80 /></picture></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wonderful resort where you can immerse yourself in the role of island manager and caretaker for the Egglins, rare and mysterious critters taking the world by storm.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME A FARMER </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/cc05b5a2afc20b1658c42a22fcdfb136.poster.avif?t=1746074952\" width=400 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/cc05b5a2afc20b1658c42a22fcdfb136.webm?t=1746074952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/cc05b5a2afc20b1658c42a22fcdfb136.mp4?t=1746074952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 10 different crops, you'll have your work cut out for you learning how to grow all of them and figuring out your Egglin's favorite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DECORATE YOUR ISLAND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/673111e9f2096f927529c8341ac6fcd8.poster.avif?t=1746074952\" width=400 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/673111e9f2096f927529c8341ac6fcd8.webm?t=1746074952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/673111e9f2096f927529c8341ac6fcd8.mp4?t=1746074952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every good environment deserves some homey touches, and with over 60 different island decorations, you can customize every inch of your island to suit your fancy. The Egglins will appreciate you for making their world your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECT EGGLINS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/bafef0cc07cdaff0eebb47d1871298c9.poster.avif?t=1746074952\" width=400 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/bafef0cc07cdaff0eebb47d1871298c9.webm?t=1746074952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/bafef0cc07cdaff0eebb47d1871298c9.mp4?t=1746074952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the first egg hatches you'll be dying to hatch more and collect the over 60 known Egglins throughout the world! And don't worry about losing track of them. The Bestiary logs all of your discovered Egglins throughout your collecting adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So are you ready to take this once in a lifetime opportunity and start your Egglin collecting adventure?\u00a0Just remember, be good to the Egglins, and the Egglins...<i>may be good to you</i>... possibly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Oh and no return deposit for the Island.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Have fun!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/62cff07c70f3bf56faa72dca84a748a4.poster.avif?t=1746074952\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/62cff07c70f3bf56faa72dca84a748a4.apng?t=1746074952\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span><strong>Welcome to CRITTER ISLE!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/150a7420403147241bc96f11b2721ad9.poster.avif?t=1746074952\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/150a7420403147241bc96f11b2721ad9.apng?t=1746074952\" class=\"bb_img\" width=80 height=80 /></picture></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wonderful resort where you can immerse yourself in the role of island manager and caretaker for the Egglins, rare and mysterious critters taking the world by storm.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME A FARMER </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/cc05b5a2afc20b1658c42a22fcdfb136.poster.avif?t=1746074952\" width=400 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/cc05b5a2afc20b1658c42a22fcdfb136.webm?t=1746074952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/cc05b5a2afc20b1658c42a22fcdfb136.mp4?t=1746074952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 10 different crops, you'll have your work cut out for you learning how to grow all of them and figuring out your Egglin's favorite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DECORATE YOUR ISLAND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/673111e9f2096f927529c8341ac6fcd8.poster.avif?t=1746074952\" width=400 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/673111e9f2096f927529c8341ac6fcd8.webm?t=1746074952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/673111e9f2096f927529c8341ac6fcd8.mp4?t=1746074952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every good environment deserves some homey touches, and with over 60 different island decorations, you can customize every inch of your island to suit your fancy. The Egglins will appreciate you for making their world your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECT EGGLINS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/bafef0cc07cdaff0eebb47d1871298c9.poster.avif?t=1746074952\" width=400 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/bafef0cc07cdaff0eebb47d1871298c9.webm?t=1746074952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/bafef0cc07cdaff0eebb47d1871298c9.mp4?t=1746074952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the first egg hatches you'll be dying to hatch more and collect the over 60 known Egglins throughout the world! And don't worry about losing track of them. The Bestiary logs all of your discovered Egglins throughout your collecting adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So are you ready to take this once in a lifetime opportunity and start your Egglin collecting adventure?\u00a0Just remember, be good to the Egglins, and the Egglins...<i>may be good to you</i>... possibly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Oh and no return deposit for the Island.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Have fun!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Jump right in and hatch your first Egglin, let creativity flow as you learn how to manage your Egglin's wants and needs through food and play. Zen out to the blissful comforts of decorating your island how you see fit, and bask in the rewards your Egglins provide as you grow your Egglin empire.",
